WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
What you notice depends on what you are asked to find.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
People counting passes can miss an unexpected visitor.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Even specialists hunting lung nodules sometimes miss a surprising shape in a scan.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But that's not the whole story. Faster unexpected objects can be easier to notice.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
These studies tell us about attention, not a magic shortcut to better focus.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before buying any audio routine, check what it contains, what the evidence supports,
and whether a free option meets your need.
